      "side": 1,
      "message": "lightbar_sleep_exit() register in HOOK_CHIPSET_RESUME. When system boot from G3/S5/S4 to S0, it also trigger HOOK_CHIPSET_RESUME.\nFrom V9 SPEC, UX define lightbar behavior from S0ix/S3 to S0, not G3/S5/S4 to S0.\nI\u0027m not sure if there is other HOOK (or other way) can be only called from S0ix/S3 to S0, so I create this flag, lightbar_enter_s0ix_s3, to know which state system go from. Then, we can base on it to control lightbar.",
